OL,4,BYorkshire re-sign Pakistan batter Imam 
OL,5,GYorkshire have signed Pakistan batter  
OL,6,GImam-ul-Haq for the 2027 County        
OL,7,GChampionship season.                   
OL,9,FThe 30-year-old will be available for  
OL,10,Fthe entire red-ball campaign and the   
OL,11,FOne-Day Cup.                           
OL,13,FImam, the nephew of Inzamam-ul-Haq,    
OL,14,Faveraged 98.28 across eight List A     
OL,15,Ffixtures during a spell with the White 
OL,16,FRose in 2025.                          
OL,18,F"Yorkshire has always felt like a      
OL,19,Fspecial place to play cricket, and I'm 
OL,20,Freally pleased to be coming back next  
OL,21,Fyear," he told the club website.       
